# Accessibility

- Visible `:focus-visible` ring in `--verdigris` on every interactive control
- Nothing focusable without a focus style
- Every iframe: descriptive `title` (`Preview: …`)
- Copy announcements reach an `aria-live="polite"` region
- Colour is never the only signal for state (pair with label / border / text)
- Plate keyboard order: preview → copy → open → playground
- Detail tabs: real tab semantics + arrow keys (see `55_catalogue`)
- Decorative specimen roots: `aria-hidden`; announce lock/state outside the tape

When in doubt, prefer the quality floor in `docs/design-spec.md` §8.
